SUMMARY:New Year's Eve Showcase (main showroom)
LOCATION:Washington
DESCRIPTION:Laugh your way into 2027 with top comedians from the DMV! Get a
  great sampling of local talent and ring in the new year in style. Plus\, e
 veryone gets a pass for one free admission in 2027.\n\n7:30 show: $35 per p
 erson GA\, $45 reserved seating. Everyone in attendance also gets a free pa
 ss for a 2027 show at the DC Improv.\n\n10:15 countdown show: $75 per perso
 n GA\, $85 reserved seating. The ticket includes admission\, a champagne to
 ast at midnight\, a fruit / cheese / cracker plate and party favors. Each p
 erson in attendance also gets a free pass for a 2027 show at the DC Improv.
 \n\nThe lineup: Stacey Axler\, Lafayette Wright\, Rob Stant\, Ty Davis\, Ra
 ndy Syphax\, Matt Deakins\n\nAll sales are final. Refunds and exchanges are
  offered only when a show is canceled or rescheduled.\n\nAdmission Policies
 \n\nPatrons must be 18 or older to attend events or classes at the DC Impro
 v. Any exceptions are clearly noted in the event descriptions.\n\nThere is 
 a two-item minimum per customer. This can be any combination of food items 
 or beverages. Bottled water and soft drinks count as items. (The two-item m
 inimum does not apply to comedy classes.)\n\nCoupons or passes for free adm
 ission cannot be used for a show listed as a "special event."\n\nSeating Po
 licies\n\nThe early show will be seated by time of arrival. The earlier you
  arrive\, the more options you'll have. Please note that the size of your p
 arty can affect what options are available to you\, as certain tables and a
 reas are designated for larger parties.\n\nThe late show will have assigned
  seating. Assignments are made in order of ticket purchase. Generally speak
 ing\, the earlier you buy tickets\, the closer you will be to the stage.\n\
 nIf tickets are designated as being at a "reserved table\," your party will
  have a table to itself. For general admission tickets\, if your party does
  not fill an entire table\, you may be sharing a table with other patrons.\
 nMore info: https://comedyatlas.app/comedy-atlas/event/new-year-s-eve-showc
 ase-main-showroom/
